&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; line-height:14.5pt; "&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.5pt"&gt;本数&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width:171.0pt; border:solid black 0.5pt; border-left:none; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; height:17.25pt"&gt;
