&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:58.3pt; text-indent:-58.3pt; line-height:14.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;,serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
